    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/f70555526bff44d8193b25b9d8c002a7.poster.avif?t=1718011241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/f70555526bff44d8193b25b9d8c002a7.webm?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/f70555526bff44d8193b25b9d8c002a7.mp4?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a haunting journey through a shadowy world in this atmospheric 2D platformer, drawing inspiration from classics like Oddworld, as well as modern games such as Limbo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/260445f5f601c6985dfd0cd90bb7fe4c.poster.avif?t=1718011241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/260445f5f601c6985dfd0cd90bb7fe4c.webm?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/260445f5f601c6985dfd0cd90bb7fe4c.mp4?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>\u2022 <strong>Experience a captivating 1-2 hour dark tale, perfect for an immersive playthrough on a rainy night.<br><br>\u2022 <strong>Immerse yourself in a classic-style 2D platformer with prerendered 3D graphics, reminiscent of games like Oddworld.<br><br>\u2022 <strong>Navigate haunting landscapes and encounter mysterious creatures as you search for a lost soul in the shadows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/9cc2d2a4f1e54873428e8c86ccfcc53c.poster.avif?t=1718011241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/9cc2d2a4f1e54873428e8c86ccfcc53c.webm?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/9cc2d2a4f1e54873428e8c86ccfcc53c.mp4?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></strong></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/f70555526bff44d8193b25b9d8c002a7.poster.avif?t=1718011241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/f70555526bff44d8193b25b9d8c002a7.webm?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/f70555526bff44d8193b25b9d8c002a7.mp4?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a haunting journey through a shadowy world in this atmospheric 2D platformer, drawing inspiration from classics like Oddworld, as well as modern games such as Limbo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/260445f5f601c6985dfd0cd90bb7fe4c.poster.avif?t=1718011241\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/260445f5f601c6985dfd0cd90bb7fe4c.webm?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327250/extras/260445f5f601c6985dfd0cd90bb7fe4c.mp4?t=1718011241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>\u2022 <strong>Experience a captivating 1-2 hour dark tale, perfect for an immersive playthrough on a rainy night.<br><br>\u2022 <strong>Immerse yourself in a classic-style 2D platformer with prerendered 3D graphics, reminiscent of games like Oddworld.<br><br>\u2022 <strong>Navigate haunting landscapes and encounter mysterious creatures as you search for a lost soul in the shadows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app